### Product Manager API - manual request collection
### Open in VS Code with the REST Client extension, or in Visual Studio, and click "Send Request".
### Start the API first:  cd src/ProductManager.Api && dotnet run

@host = http://localhost:5186
@contentType = application/json

### Health check
GET {{host}}/health

### Categories - use one of these IDs when creating a product
GET {{host}}/api/categories

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 1. GET /api/products - first page
GET {{host}}/api/products

### 1a. Paged and sorted by stock, lowest first
GET {{host}}/api/products?page=1&pageSize=5&sortBy=stock&sortDescending=false

### 1b. Filtered by category and free text
GET {{host}}/api/products?categoryId=1&search=aur

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 2. POST /api/products - create. The 6-digit id comes back in the response.
# @name createProduct
POST {{host}}/api/products
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Meridian 13 Ultrabook",
  "description": "13-inch ultrabook, 16GB RAM, 512GB SSD.",
  "price": 1149.00,
  "initialStock": 12,
  "lowStockThreshold": 4,
  "categoryId": 2
}

@productId = {{createProduct.response.body.id}}

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 3. GET /api/products/{id} - includes the stock movement history
GET {{host}}/api/products/{{productId}}

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 4. PUT /api/products/{id} - edit the details
PUT {{host}}/api/products/{{productId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Meridian 13 Ultrabook (2026)",
  "description": "13-inch ultrabook, 32GB RAM, 1TB SSD.",
  "price": 1349.00,
  "lowStockThreshold": 5,
  "categoryId": 2
}

### 4a. PUT with an absolute stock take - recorded as an Adjustment movement
PUT {{host}}/api/products/{{productId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Meridian 13 Ultrabook (2026)",
  "description": "13-inch ultrabook, 32GB RAM, 1TB SSD.",
  "price": 1349.00,
  "lowStockThreshold": 5,
  "categoryId": 2,
  "stockQuantity": 20
}

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 7. POST add-to-stock - body is optional and only carries the audit reason
POST {{host}}/api/products/{{productId}}/add-to-stock/8
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "reason": "Delivery GRN-5512"
}

### 7a. add-to-stock with no body at all
POST {{host}}/api/products/{{productId}}/add-to-stock/2

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 6. POST decrement-stock
POST {{host}}/api/products/{{productId}}/decrement-stock/5
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "reason": "Customer order #4821"
}

### 6a. Decrement beyond what is held - expect 409 with availableStock and requestedQuantity
POST {{host}}/api/products/{{productId}}/decrement-stock/99999

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 8. GET /api/products/search?name= - partial, case-insensitive
GET {{host}}/api/products/search?name=meridian

### 8a. Lower case matches just the same
GET {{host}}/api/products/search?name=LUMEN

### 8b. No search term - expect 400
GET {{host}}/api/products/search?name=

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 9. GET /api/products/stock-level - inclusive range
GET {{host}}/api/products/stock-level?min=0&max=5

### 9a. Out of stock only
GET {{host}}/api/products/stock-level?min=0&max=0

### 9b. Open-ended upper bound
GET {{host}}/api/products/stock-level?min=50

### 9c. Minimum above maximum - expect 400
GET {{host}}/api/products/stock-level?min=50&max=10

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 5. DELETE /api/products/{id} - expect 204, then 404 on the follow-up read
DELETE {{host}}/api/products/{{productId}}

### 5a. Confirm it is gone
GET {{host}}/api/products/{{productId}}

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### Error cases

### Unknown product - expect 404
GET {{host}}/api/products/999999

### Invalid payload - expect 400 with one entry per bad field
POST {{host}}/api/products
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "",
  "price": -5,
  "initialStock": -1,
  "lowStockThreshold": -2,
  "categoryId": 0
}

### Unknown category - expect 404
POST {{host}}/api/products
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Orphan Product",
  "price": 10.00,
  "initialStock": 1,
  "lowStockThreshold": 1,
  "categoryId": 9999
}

### Zero quantity on a stock move - expect 400
POST {{host}}/api/products/100000/add-to-stock/0
